X: 1
T: Like The Golden Sun Ascending
C: Words: Thomas Hansen Kingo, 1689.  Translated by George Alfred Taylor Rygh, 1908.
C: Music: 'Werde Munter' Johann Schop, 1642.
C: Setting: "Hymnal for Church and Home" (Danish Evangelical Lutheran Synods), 1927.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music and Lyrics source: "Hymnal for Church and Home" (Danish Evangelical Lutheran Synods), 1927 Hymn 115 and "The Lutheran Hymnary", 1913 Hymn 325
M: 4/4 % time signature
L: 1/4 % default length
